    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108355" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόδρομ-ος</span></b>  (A), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>running under,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄχθῃσιν ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>A.</u>
					802
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέτρος ἴχνους ὑ.</span> a stone
				<i>in the way of</i> his foot, <i><span class="en">
